{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Kof6qw6RZkmXLfnzmqDsUH","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Claude Pro plan price per month US\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"What is the Pro plan?\",\"url\":\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/8325606-what-is-the-pro-plan\"},{\"title\":\"Plans & pricing\",\"url\":\"https://claude.com/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Introducing Claude Pro \\\\ Anthropic\",\"url\":\"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-pro\"},{\"title\":\"Pricing - Claude Platform Docs\",\"url\":\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"How is my Team plan bill calculated?\",\"url\":\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/9267289-how-is-my-team-plan-bill-calculated\"},{\"title\":\"Getting started with Claude for nonprofits · Claude Academy\",\"url\":\"https://academy.claude.com/tutorials/getting-started-with-claude-for-nonprofits\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Cowork\",\"url\":\"https://claude.com/product/cowork\"},{\"title\":\"Buy usage bundles\",\"url\":\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/14246112-buy-usage-bundles\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Team plan for scientists\",\"url\":\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/16634237-claude-team-plan-for-scientists\"},{\"title\":\"What is the Team plan?\",\"url\":\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/9266767-what-is-the-team-plan\"}]\n\nFor US customers, Claude Pro is **$20 per month** when billed monthly. Anthropic's pricing page also lists a lower effective rate for annual billing.\n\n- **Monthly billing:** Anthropic's support article says the Pro plan is available for $20 per month (US), with pricing in your local currency where supported.\n- **Annual billing:** The pricing page shows $17 per month with annual subscription discount ($200 billed up front). $20 if billed monthly.\n- **Taxes and regional differences:** Some regions include applicable taxes in the displayed price while others add tax at checkout.\n- **Changes:** Anthropic notes that price and plans are subject to change at Anthropic's discretion. Check claude.ai/upgrade for the latest figures.\n- **API not included:** The Pro subscription does not include API usage through the Claude Console. API access is billed separately.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4d139bce-33a4-48d2-8d8d-cfba7b1108f0","uuid":"0ec5d58b-f326-43d2-b012-240b5a8c6ae5","timestamp":"2026-10-18T10:48:48.350Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Claude Pro plan price per month US","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_0134LcBUZXCxn4PfgJYH5DpL","content":[{"title":"What is the Pro plan?","url":"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/8325606-what-is-the-pro-plan"},{"title":"Plans & pricing","url":"https://claude.com/pricing"},{"title":"Introducing Claude Pro \\ Anthropic","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-pro"},{"title":"Pricing - Claude Platform Docs","url":"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing"},{"title":"How is my Team plan bill calculated?","url":"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/9267289-how-is-my-team-plan-bill-calculated"},{"title":"Getting started with Claude for nonprofits · Claude Academy","url":"https://academy.claude.com/tutorials/getting-started-with-claude-for-nonprofits"},{"title":"Claude Cowork","url":"https://claude.com/product/cowork"},{"title":"Buy usage bundles","url":"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/14246112-buy-usage-bundles"},{"title":"Claude Team plan for scientists","url":"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/16634237-claude-team-plan-for-scientists"},{"title":"What is the Team plan?","url":"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/9266767-what-is-the-team-plan"}]},"For US customers, Claude Pro is **$20 per month** when billed monthly. Anthropic's pricing page also lists a lower effective rate for annual billing.\n\n- **Monthly billing:** Anthropic's support article says the Pro plan is avai